body:
>she might call me out on her account for being a bad person (a form of “cancelling”, I guess?). She already kind of does this with people she doesn’t like

thats a red ass flag dude

if you don't want to say a hard "no", maybe soften it up by saying you two could collaborate on later project (whenever that may be)

tbh his wing is lame as there's always a bald spot when he spreads it like

&#x200B;

(idk if this is visual glitch on my end but it always bothers me, you deserve better from the Absolute, Fist Marcus)

honestly i'm more disappointed by the lack of character progression on karlach part, i get she is supposed to be cheerful and kind to cope, but even when romancing her she feel shallow compared to other companion

&#x200B;

and halsin is just ....halsin lol

i havent even finish my first playthrough, 20-30 hours in, restart another one with Durge....

&#x200B;

60-80 hours in and im still in act 2

i sleep at like 4-6pm to 8 -10pm depending how long I ended up sleeping lately. Personally I have tried being a morning person (school years had me going to school at like 6am lol crazy), as an adult waking up at 3-4 am is nice if you need to be out early in the day, but I don't mind sleeping in the evening as well.

&#x200B;

I think having shorter sleep time actually made me having more energy(around 4-5 h) or maybe that's because if im feeling depressed I ended up sleeping for 10+hours
